# The first battle's options menu with the UPGRADES line shown (players see
# it; every other run hides it): the line under the original's seven, the
# page over the battle, a switch turned on, Done, the menu back, and the
# battle going on. In test mode nothing is saved.
# upgrades-line: shown
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000
Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300 Right Return idle:300
Return idle:9000 Return idle:6000                   # leave the editor; the story
Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000  # its screens, one key each
Return idle:6000 Return idle:6000 Return            # the battle begins
steps:5 Escape idle:200 @snap:options                # the battle's options menu
Down Down Down Down Down Down Down idle:100 @snap:line
Return idle:300 @snap:page
Return idle:300 @snap:switched
Down Return idle:300 @snap:back
Escape idle:300 steps:5 @snap:battle
